   "title": "Generate GST invoice"
  },
  "description": "Use this when the user wants a GST invoice in the GST invoice format (a GST bill format or tax invoice for India) as a PDF and Excel file. Convert what the user pastes, or an uploaded photo or image of a bill or order, into the fields: seller {name, gstin, address, state}, buyer {name, gstin, address, state} and items [{description, hsn, qty, unit, rate, discount, gst_rate}]; details is only a fallback for text you cannot split. Decides CGST + SGST (or UTGST) or IGST from the place of supply, reads state codes from GSTINs, flags an invalid GSTIN without refusing, adds the HSN-wise summary, rounds the total to the nearest rupee and writes amounts in words (lakh, crore). Does not make an e-invoice (IRN, QR) or e-way bill, does not pick GST rates, and does not compute cess. Do not use for export invoices, invoices outside India or invoices without GST.",
  "execution": {
   "taskSupport": "forbidden"
  },
